      "label": "Infrastructure Drift Detection",
      "description": "Runs a read-only plan (e.g. terraform plan -detailed-exitcode) for every stack on a schedule and after each apply. Any planned change on an unchanged codebase is drift; the diff is attached to an alert and, for production, an incident ticket.",
